  <!-- One-press entry "Open Android Auto" (raAction 2), right after the menu entry. Property 55 is its UUID: without
       one, iDrive refuses to store a plugin entry on a favourite key. Keep the UUID fixed: a new one orphans keys
       already stored. Connected: Android Auto comes to the front; otherwise our menu opens (focusEvent 53) with the
       status, and nbt-aad is started if needed. -->
